;; iriai 入会 — actor manifest (clj-native, kotoba-Datom-native)
;; The non-profit GLOBAL LIFELINE-COMMONS actor: the four lifelines (電気/水道/ガス/通信)
;; held as a traditional commons (入会権), delivered §1.16 social-security IN-KIND (cash≡0),
;; governed 1 SBT = 1 vote. The System-of-Systems umbrella over the producer actors
;; (hikari/mizuho/kamado/noroshi) covering infra + 資金 (funding) + 管理 (management).
;; ADR-2606272200 (R0).
{:actor/id        "iriai"
 :actor/glyph     "入"
 :actor/tier      :tier-b
 :actor/integrates ["hikari" "mizuho" "kamado" "noroshi"]
 :actor/domain    "iriai.etzhayyim.com"
 :actor/kind      :lifeline-commons-synthesizer
 :actor/purpose   "Global lifeline-commons (ライフライン: 電気/水道/ガス/通信) System-of-Systems synthesizer + funding + governance. 入会 (iriai) = the traditional Japanese COMMONS — shared rights of use over a collectively-held resource; here the resource is the four lifelines. The umbrella over the producer actors (電気→hikari 光 · 水道→mizuho 水穂 · ガス→kamado 竈 · 通信→noroshi 烽), the way kaname 要 / amime 網目 synthesize across single-domain mirrors. THREE LAYERS: (infra) edge-primary commons-gap = (1−coverage)·essentiality·vulnerability + resilience (single-source SPOF / N-1) per region × lifeline → verdict {:await-consent :provision :reinforce :redundancy :maintain :monitor}; (資金 fund) each provision/reinforce/redundancy cell → a §1.16 social-security IN-KIND funding proposal on the existing non-profit rails (donation → TitheRouter 10% → Public Fund → grant/milestone-escrow/in-kind), cash≡0 to the consumer, imputed market-equivalent value for transparency only (the subaru 昴 precedent + Displacement-Dividend coupling); (管理 manage) each proposal wrapped in 1 SBT = 1 vote governance (20% quorum / 50% / 48h timelock) + Council Lv6+/Lv7+ attestation, actuation-class :intent (compute-only R0 — live energize/flow/ignite/activate is the producer cell under Council Lv7+ + operator-DID + member-sig), no-server-key (member-CACAO leash). A COVERAGE + RESILIENCE map, NEVER a target-list, NEVER a shut-off list — a lifeline is a commons right, never withheld as leverage, never billed, never disconnected. ASSESSMENT + R0 DESIGN ONLY — iriai never produces nor actuates a lifeline; production is the producer actors' under Council. Inversion of the for-profit utility (Veolia/Suez/utility-PE) and of utility-as-coercion."
 :actor/status    :r0
